From b49c383de9177c1773720d71719c501c62bea8ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wenyao Gao <wenyao.gao28@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:12:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat: make the GPUGet response cache TTL configurable

AMD_GPU_GET_CACHE_TTL is parsed once in cmd/exporter and carried through the existing exporter and gpuagent options; unset keeps the 15 s cache and 0s issues a new GPUGet on every read. A zero-value GPUAgentClient literal now gets no cache instead of 15 s; no upstream test relies on that.
---
